From f8256647d532c022d9d3bd3d0927e12885fa20e4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: curnane-lab <227407786+curnane-lab@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 11:54:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] fix(gdn): drive the RGDR family through an R1-consistent
 private aclnn runtime

The R1 OPP carries only the RecurrentGatedDeltaRule family and shadows the
wheel OPP's base-op host registration when it precedes the wheel OPP in
ASCEND_CUSTOM_OPP_PATH (required for the recover op's bin lookup). A base-op
launch through the wheel opapi or stable launcher then faults (507057,
probed). With the flag on, both the verify (recover entry) and the plain
decode (base entry) RGDR calls go through a private _AclnnRuntime whose
custom library is the R1 libcust_opapi.so; conv/chunk ops keep the installed
package's backends. Probe: recover and stock via the private runtime are
bitwise identical to the wheel reference, records key bit-exact, sentinel
intact (n10/N10_probe_recover.json).

Signed-off-by: curnane-lab <227407786+curnane-lab@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 vllm_ascend/ops/gdn.py         |  16 ++-
 vllm_ascend/ops/gdn_recover.py | 233 +++++++++++++++++++++++----------
 2 files changed, 175 insertions(+), 74 deletions(-)

